==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|i|n}}

===Etymology===
From the same root as {{m|fi|ihminen}}, which was spelled ''inhiminen'' in the 16th century.<ref>{{R:Hakkinen 2004}}</ref> Compare {{m|fi|inehmo}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈinɦimilːinen]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|in|hi|mil|li|nen|lang=fi}}

